{"seq":2,"slug":"mathematization-of-nature","title":"自然的数学化","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/ideas-and-methods/mathematics-and-dynamics/mathematization-of-nature","wordCount":1513,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"自然的数学化\">自然的数学化</h1><p>《自然哲学的数学原理》——书名本身就是一份宣言。&quot;自然哲学&quot;在 17 世纪指对自然界的研究，而牛顿要为它建立&quot;数学原理&quot;。这个组合在当时近乎挑衅：自然哲学历来被视为定性的、思辨的领域，由亚里士多德式的&quot;本质&quot;与&quot;目的&quot;主导；牛顿却宣称，自然的根本规律可以、而且应当用<strong>数学</strong>精确表述。这一&quot;自然的数学化&quot;纲领，是近代物理学得以诞生的方法论核心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>牛顿数学化纲领的精髓，是把物理问题系统地<strong>转译</strong>为数学问题，求解之后再<strong>转译</strong>回物理结论。运动不再用&quot;重物趋向其自然位置&quot;这类定性语言描述，而被还原为可测量的量（质量、力、距离、时间）之间的数学关系。最凝练的体现，就是第二运动定律——力等于质量与加速度的乘积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>F</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{F} = m\\vec{a}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>以及万有引力定律——任意两个质点之间的引力，与它们质量的乘积成正比、与距离的平方成反比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = G\\frac{m_1 m_2}{r^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Phen[物理现象&lt;br/&gt;行星轨道/落体/潮汐] --&gt; Quant[抽象为可测量:&lt;br/&gt;质量 m、力 F、距离 r、时间 t]&#10;    Quant --&gt; Math[建立数学关系&lt;br/&gt;F=ma 与平方反比定律]&#10;    Math --&gt; Solve[数学求解&lt;br/&gt;几何/流数推导]&#10;    Solve --&gt; Pred[推回物理结论&lt;br/&gt;可定量预测的轨道与现象]&#10;    Pred --&gt; Test[与观测对照检验]&#10;    Test -. 修正 .-&gt; Math\">flowchart TD\n    Phen[物理现象&lt;br/&gt;行星轨道/落体/潮汐] --&gt; Quant[抽象为可测量:&lt;br/&gt;质量 m、力 F、距离 r、时间 t]\n    Quant --&gt; Math[建立数学关系&lt;br/&gt;F=ma 与平方反比定律]\n    Math --&gt; Solve[数学求解&lt;br/&gt;几何/流数推导]\n    Solve --&gt; Pred[推回物理结论&lt;br/&gt;可定量预测的轨道与现象]\n    Pred --&gt; Test[与观测对照检验]\n    Test -. 修正 .-&gt; Math</pre><p>下表对比&quot;数学化之前&quot;与&quot;牛顿之后&quot;两种自然哲学的取向：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>亚里士多德式自然哲学</th>\n<th>牛顿式数学化自然哲学</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解释方式</td>\n<td>定性的本质与目的因</td>\n<td>定量的数学定律</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运动观</td>\n<td>物体趋向其&quot;自然位置&quot;</td>\n<td>力改变物体的运动状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心问题</td>\n<td>&quot;为什么&quot;（终极目的）</td>\n<td>&quot;如何&quot;（可测的定量关系）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证手段</td>\n<td>与日常经验是否吻合</td>\n<td>与精确观测/测量是否吻合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测能力</td>\n<td>弱，难以定量</td>\n<td>强，可定量预报未观测情形</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"公理化的体系结构\">公理化的体系结构</h2><p>牛顿不仅把现象数学化，更把整部《原理》组织成一座<strong>公理化的演绎大厦</strong>，刻意模仿欧几里得《几何原本》的结构。</p>\n<h3 id=\"从定义到定律到命题\">从定义到定律到命题</h3><p>全书以一组<strong>定义</strong>（质量、动量、各种力）开篇，接着是三条作为公理的<strong>运动定律</strong>，然后由它们出发，像证明几何定理一样逐条<strong>推导命题</strong>。从惯性定律、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>F</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{F}=m\\vec{a}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和作用反作用定律这三条公理出发，牛顿推出了开普勒三定律、潮汐、岁差、彗星轨道乃至月球运动的种种细节。这种&quot;少数公理生成丰富结论&quot;的结构，本身就是数学化的胜利——它表明纷繁的天地现象可以被压缩进极少数普遍定律。</p>\n<h3 id=\"统一的解释力\">统一的解释力</h3><p>可以用一段伪代码勾勒这种&quot;公理生成结论&quot;的演绎结构——这正是《原理》的骨架：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"公理:&#10;  Law1  惯性: 不受力则匀速直线运动&#10;  Law2  F = m * a&#10;  Law3  作用力 = -反作用力&#10;  GRAV  F = G * m1 * m2 / r^2     // 由现象演绎得出&#10;&#10;推导:&#10;  从 Law2 + GRAV  -&gt;  向心力轨道  -&gt;  开普勒三定律&#10;  从 GRAV 作用于流体  -&gt;  潮汐 + 地球扁球形状&#10;  从 GRAV 作用于地球赤道隆起  -&gt;  春分点岁差\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>公理:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Law1  惯性: 不受力则匀速直线运动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Law2  F = m * a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Law3  作用力 = -反作用力</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  GRAV  F = G * m1 * m2 / r^2     // 由现象演绎得出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>推导:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  从 Law2 + GRAV  ->  向心力轨道  ->  开普勒三定律</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  从 GRAV 作用于流体  ->  潮汐 + 地球扁球形状</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  从 GRAV 作用于地球赤道隆起  ->  春分点岁差</span></span></code></pre></div><p>数学化最震撼之处，在于它的<strong>统一</strong>能力。同一个平方反比定律，既解释苹果落地，又解释月球不飞走，还解释行星椭圆轨道、海洋潮汐、地球因自转而成的扁球形状、春分点的缓慢岁差。在牛顿之前，这些是彼此无关的现象；在牛顿之后，它们成了同一条数学定律的不同表现。这种&quot;一法贯通万象&quot;的力量，正是数学化纲领最有说服力的辩护。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数学定律与物理实在\">数学定律与物理实在</h2><p>牛顿数学化纲领引出一个深刻的哲学问题：那些精确的数学定律，究竟是自然本身的<strong>真实结构</strong>，还是仅仅是描述现象的<strong>方便工具</strong>？</p>\n<h3 id=\"牛顿的实在论倾向\">牛顿的实在论倾向</h3><p>牛顿本人倾向于实在论：他相信引力是物质的真实性质，数学定律捕捉的是世界的真实秩序，而非人为的方便记法。这一信念又与他的神学交织——他认为这套精妙的数学秩序正是上帝智慧设计的明证（详见&quot;绝对空间与绝对时间&quot;一文）。但同时，他对引力的<strong>终极原因</strong>保持悬置（&quot;我不杜撰假说&quot;），这使他的立场显得既坚定又克制：他确信引力的数学描述为真，却不强行断言它背后的形而上学机制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"留给后世的纲领\">留给后世的纲领</h3><p>牛顿没有解决&quot;数学为何如此有效地描述自然&quot;这一难题——这个问题至今仍困扰着科学哲学家（维格纳称之为&quot;数学不可思议的有效性&quot;）。但他确立了一个不容回头的方向：此后的物理学，无论是麦克斯韦的电磁理论、爱因斯坦的相对论还是量子力学，都接受了&quot;自然规律以数学定律的形式存在、并可被数学精确表述&quot;这一牛顿式前提。即便相对论修正了牛顿的具体定律，它修正的方式——用更深的数学结构（黎曼几何）替换较浅的——本身仍是彻头彻尾&quot;牛顿式&quot;的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>《原理》书名&quot;自然哲学的数学原理&quot;即纲领宣言：自然的根本规律可用数学精确表述，挑战了定性、思辨的旧自然哲学。</li>\n<li>数学化的精髓是把物理现象抽象为可测量（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>F</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{F}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>），建立数学关系（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>F</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{F}=m\\vec{a}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、平方反比定律），求解后再推回可检验的物理结论。</li>\n<li>《原理》模仿欧几里得，以定义—公理（三定律）—命题的公理化结构，由少数公理推出开普勒定律、潮汐、岁差等丰富结论。</li>\n<li>数学化最震撼的成就是统一：同一平方反比定律贯通落体、月球、行星、潮汐与地球形状等原本无关的现象。</li>\n<li>牛顿倾向实在论（数学定律为自然真实秩序），却悬置引力终极原因；他确立的&quot;自然以数学定律存在&quot;前提，被此后全部物理学继承。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自然的数学化","id":"自然的数学化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"公理化的体系结构","id":"公理化的体系结构"},{"level":3,"text":"从定义到定律到命题","id":"从定义到定律到命题"},{"level":3,"text":"统一的解释力","id":"统一的解释力"},{"level":2,"text":"数学定律与物理实在","id":"数学定律与物理实在"},{"level":3,"text":"牛顿的实在论倾向","id":"牛顿的实在论倾向"},{"level":3,"text":"留给后世的纲领","id":"留给后世的纲领"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"流数术与几何方法","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/ideas-and-methods/mathematics-and-dynamics/fluxions-and-geometry"},"next":{"title":"炼金术、神学与方法","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/ideas-and-methods/context-and-legacy/alchemy-theology-and-method"}}